flowchart TB
  shape[1 shape] --> paused[2 paused?] --> bot[3 Turnstile]
  bot --> text[4-6 shared text rules: clean, length, links, personal info]
  text --> hash[7 monthly IP hash]
  hash --> rate[8 one query: 10 min, 24 h, site-wide 5 min]
  rate -->|burst| raid[newcomer hold on + alert]
  rate --> dup[9 duplicate body hash]
  dup --> filter[10 word filter]
  filter --> hold[11 hold?]
  hold --> insert[12 insert, crew number]
  insert --> alert[13 alert if held]
  alert --> reply[14 crew number + undo token]
